Unix Timeline | CHANGELOG
===================================================

v0.5

- Add 1st OpenSolaris version and put name of second on the timeline
- Add info-connector on the graph
- Add UXP/DS

v0.4.2

- Restore copyright attributions and mentions that I mistakenly removed
- Change background colour to a light grey to make OpenBSD's line more visible

v0.4.1

- Change OpenSolaris release date to use the date when Sun open sourced the source code and not the 1st release
- Fix AIX 7.2 release date

v0.4

- Add Amdahl UTS
- Add RISC iX
- Add RISC/os
- Add DYNIX/ptx

v0.3

- Add UNIX/32V
- Add date of Venix version
- Add DG/UX
- Add SINIX
- Add UNICOS version history

v0.2.1

- Fix CSV formatting
- Fix NEWS-OS version dates

v0.2

- Add ULTRIX version history
- Add 386/ix
- Add Venix
- Add NEWS-OS
- Change IRIX and IWSD colour to be the one of Silicon Graphics
- Change A/UX colour to be different than the one of AIX
- Change style of the connections

v0.1

This is the first version. I added a lot of historical Unix. Since it's based on [FabioLolix BSD-TimeLine](https://github.com/FabioLolix/BSD-Timeline), I trimmed some of the systems there.
